s=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/3591c8d190f30a26f7481884527e32f5.poster.avif?t=1752873685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/3591c8d190f30a26f7481884527e32f5.webm?t=1752873685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/3591c8d190f30a26f7481884527e32f5.mp4?t=1752873685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/0d497598e479b5a87346ade68402dc1e.poster.avif?t=1752873685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/0d497598e479b5a87346ade68402dc1e.webm?t=1752873685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/0d497598e479b5a87346ade68402dc1e.mp4?t=1752873685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its engaging turn-based combat, Ettrian - The Elf Prince offers a deep and strategic gameplay experience. Players must master the intricacies of battle, utilizing a variety of magical abilities and tactical maneuvers to defeat formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/b9d5901faf697476e52a47be5bc3458f.poster.avif?t=1752873685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326510/extras/b9d5901faf697476e52a47be5bc3458f.webm?t=1752873685